  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math> touches the ellipse <math><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math> at the point <math><mi>P</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of the length&nbsp;<math><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></math> (where <math><mi>O</mi></math> is the origin) is equal to"
